
 >> x := Obyekt yangi.
 >> y := Obyekt yangi.
 >> z := x.
 Chiqish yozish: ( x aynan: y ), yangi-qator.
 Chiqish yozish: ( x aynan: z ), yangi-qator.
 Chiqish yozish: ( x = y ), yangi-qator.
 Chiqish yozish: ( x = z ), yangi-qator.
 Chiqish yozish: ( x ≠ y ), yangi-qator.
 Chiqish yozish: ( x ≠ z ), yangi-qator.
 